LevelDB bb74ef739973..29465588d3df (rolled by e7ccd2eea5a7, #574), ANGLE
a18497974ed5..a999c4d6b212 (rolled by the side-project rolls #606, #612 and
#616), Skia 7a06b6cf9fc9..8a65fa27c104 (#606 and #612) and Dawn
d76611e189de..454671a2705c (#616), as served by Gitiles,
